  "summary": "Give the module a unique MS/TP address and device instance, then read heat energy (AI 10), cooling energy (AI 12), power (AI 2), flow (AI 0) and the inlet and outlet temperatures (AI 3, AI 4). Watch the info code (PIV 0) for meter events. Nothing needs to be written.",
